program that lets you force DTR high. (I was able to get Reflections 4 to
work, but Procomm and Hyperterm, etc. are probably not as they were written
only to talk to modems) I'm using a VT320 to chat with my VAX, which calls
it "RS423 with modem control." DTR handshaking might work or turning off set
DTR low on disconnect, or you could also hot wire your serial cable to make
DTR always high. I honestly don't remember how to do this, and I'm not going
to say anything, else you fry something. I have DB9/RS232/MMJ pin outs
