frequencies, anyone know what they are? I've heard most NEC Multisync
monitors can handle the sync on green in color, or B&W if you hook up green
to the monochrome pins. Check the HSync freq. first, older monitors might
not have protection against being over-clocked. Check out
http://www.netbsd.org/Documentation and hunt down DEC hardware info:Vax
http://Vaxarchive.org/hw/vs3100/index.html

