You can effectively download and manage one of these from Windows NT.
A Duplex unit can be purchased and installed on the bottom. You can add
standard 60 nsec 72 Pin SIMM memory to the unit, up to 32MB total. It speaks
PostScript Level 2. It does 600 DPI and 17 pages per minute.

