The Computer Museum sent most or all of their historical collection to
The Computer Museum History Center in Mountain View, California, and recently
have spun that off as an independent entity:

	http://www.computerhistory.org/

Three trailers arrived recently bringing the DEC collection.  This included
a PDP-1, PDP-4, PDP-5, PDP-7, various PDP-8s, PDP-9, various PDP-11s,
a DECsystem-10, a VAX, a soviet-made VAX clone, and probably a lot more
that I haven't seen  (A PDP-6 was rumored to be included, but wasn't on
display when I was last there.)



