To get the sparc2 to act as a x-term all you should have to do is install
solaris(with x and tcpip) on the sparc2 and configure the network. It should
then be as simple as creating a telnet session from the sparc2 to the
alphastation, set the display back to the sparc2 and run your X application.

Another option is to use a PC and run one of the PC based x-servers. There are
some free ones, I happen to use eXceed see:
http://www.hummingbird.com/products/nc/exceed/index.html

