then I run this very simple C code?

main()
{
  float x = 3.14;
  long i;
  for (i=0;i<1000000000;i++)
    x=x*x;
}

It runs fine on both Solaris and Linux. Dont
know why it fails on the 21164-600 (EV56) with
Digital Unix 4.0F and DEC Alpha cc

One strange thing is that if I loop only 10 times
it runs fine, but with 100 or more loops it fails.

